; Generated by scripts/generate-flt-point-evaluation.py; checked native terms.
; An actual function section with a proved
; right inverse induces the inverse ring map into the kernel
; quotient. Construct every field and both inverse identities;
; the section need not be a homomorphism before quotienting.
